This source package provides some small helper utilities for the Kubuntu Desktop.
It will install some new searchproviders, to use for Konqueror and Krunner.

Searchproviders are:

== Ubuntu.com related ==

  ubw:
      Kubuntu Wiki Direct Access
      e.g. ubw:StephanHermann => https://wiki.kubuntu.org/StephanHermann

  ubws:
      Kubuntu Wiki Search
      e.g. ubws:Kubuntu => https://wiki.kubuntu.org/?action=fullsearch&context=180&value=Kubuntu&titlesearch=Titel

  uhelp:
      Ubuntu Community Docs Direct Access
      e.g. uhelp:BinaryDriverHowto => https://help.ubuntu.com/community/BinaryDriverHowto

  uhelps:
       Ubuntu Community Docs Search
       e.g. uhelps:MP3 => https://help.ubuntu.com/community/?action=fullsearch&context=180&value=MP3&fullsearch=Text

  uman:
       Ubuntu Manuals/Manpages
       e.g. uman:dpkg-build-package => http://manpages.ubuntu.com/cgi-bin/search.py?q=dpkg-buildpackage

  upkg:
      Ubuntu Package Search
      e.g. upkg:kubuntu-desktop => http://packages.ubuntu.com/search?keywords=kubuntu-desktop&searchon=names

  upkglp:
      Ubuntu Package Search on Launchpad
      e.g. upkglp:kubuntu-desktop => https://launchpad.net/ubuntu/+search?text=kubuntu-desktop

== Launchpad.net related ==

  lp,
  ubug,
  ubugno,
  ubugft:
      Launchpad.net BugID and Term Search 
      e.g. ubug:37657 => https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/kdenetwork/+bug/37657

  uproduct,
  lpproduct:
      Launchpad.net Product Bug Finder
      e.g. lpproduct:amarok => https://bugs.launchpad.net/amarok/+bugs

  usrc,
  lpsource:
      Launchpad.net Source Package Access
      e.g. lpsource:amarok => https://launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/amarok
  uppl,
  upeople:
      Launchpad People Search
      e.g. uppl:smarter => https://launchpad.net/people/?name=smarter&searchfor=all
      
  kgit: 
    Kubuntu Git Packaging Launchpad Search
    e.g. kgit:kate => 

